A SEALED HANGAR ARENA: GROUND FLOOR
PLUS A CATWALK RING REACHED BY THREE
GENTLE RAMPS. TEN SPAWN POINTS AND
SEVEN WEAPON PICKUPS ARE SCATTERED
AROUND THE CRATES AND PILLARS.
NO ENEMIES - THIS IS A DEATHMATCH
ARENA FOR HUMAN VS HUMAN PLAY.
